1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000


2
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

3
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 47=
(This drama does not correspond)

5
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:44,230
Come catch me!

8
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:45,920
Be careful.

9
00:01:46,904 --> 00:01:49,120
- It's Chinese New Year!
- It's Chinese New Year!

10
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,760
Zhangrun, come catch me!

11
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:00,350
The fireworks are so beautiful!

12
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:07,200
See? If I do this,

13
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,870
you can't catch me!

14
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,630
Mother.

15
00:02:18,190 --> 00:02:20,000
Mother, I miss Father.

16
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,880
The bad men have all been driven away.

17
00:02:21,896 --> 00:02:23,960
Why isn't Father back yet?

18
00:02:26,150 --> 00:02:27,710
My birthday is just over

19
00:02:27,870 --> 00:02:29,430
two months away.

20
00:02:29,624 --> 00:02:31,030
Father will surely be back by then

21
00:02:31,030 --> 00:02:32,750
to celebrate my birthday with me, right?

22
00:02:36,710 --> 00:02:38,710
Your father misses you both
very much too.

23
00:02:39,128 --> 00:02:41,030
I'm sure he'll come back
as soon as he can.

24
00:02:47,710 --> 00:02:48,960
On this Chinese New Year's Eve,

25
00:02:49,430 --> 00:02:50,470
your father won't be here,

26
00:02:51,150 --> 00:02:53,590
so you must stay up
with me to welcome the Chinese New Year.

27
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:56,590
Later, we'll play Toss for Fortune.

28
00:02:56,632 --> 00:02:59,030
When the time comes,
we all have to put our strength into it

29
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,000
so we'll gain a fortune

30
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,360
and become rich.

31
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,910
I want to Toss for Fortune!

32
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:05,240
I want to get rich!

33
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,520
I want to get rich, too!

34
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:08,240
Come on.

35
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,430
When the fifth watch comes,

36
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,030
we'll take that

37
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:16,630
door bolt tied with red silk

38
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:18,240
and toss it high into the air.

39
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,280
And we have to shout,

40
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,870
"Let the cats come, let the dogs come!"

41
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:24,710
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"

42
00:03:24,808 --> 00:03:27,520
- "May big ingots roll right in!"
- "May big ingots roll right in!"

43
00:03:27,592 --> 00:03:31,750
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"

44
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:34,710
- "Let the cats come, let the dogs come!"
- "Let the cats come, let the dogs come!"

45
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:37,560
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"

46
00:03:37,624 --> 00:03:40,250
- "May big ingots roll right in!"
- "May big ingots roll right in!"

47
00:03:40,310 --> 00:03:43,430
- I'll toss mine the highest and get the richest!
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"

48
00:03:43,630 --> 00:03:44,960
I'm taller than you.

49
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,000
- And stronger than you!
- "Big ingots,"

50
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,280
- I'll be the richest!
- "roll right in!"

51
00:03:47,368 --> 00:03:51,672
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"

52
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,750
It's snowing.

53
00:04:09,570 --> 00:04:12,430
It's snowing!

54
00:04:12,470 --> 00:04:14,310
A timely snow promises a bountiful year.

55
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:17,390
May the harvest be plentiful
and bring us great fortune!

56
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:20,040
May the harvest be plentiful
and bring us great fortune!

57
00:05:32,220 --> 00:05:36,900
(Emperor, formerly the Retired Emperor)

58
00:05:40,630 --> 00:05:41,800
It's already the Hour of Zi.

59
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,830
Your Majesty, you should get some rest.

60
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,430
Han Liang

61
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,600
is still outside the Imperial Study?

62
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:53,128
(Fourth-Rank Eunuch of the Directorate
of Imperial Regalia)

63
00:05:53,140 --> 00:05:54,820
Your Majesty hasn't allowed him
to leave,

64
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:56,248
so naturally he doesn't dare leave.

65
00:05:56,430 --> 00:05:57,070
Back when

66
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:59,160
Your Majesty had only just fallen
into Wona's hands,

67
00:05:59,270 --> 00:06:00,870
Han Liang was already in a great hurry

68
00:06:00,968 --> 00:06:02,648
to urge
the enthronement of a new emperor.

69
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:05,360
That alone shows his disloyalty
to Your Majesty.

70
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:08,600
Now, after overcoming every obstacle,

71
00:06:08,610 --> 00:06:10,120
Your Majesty has regained the throne,

72
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,680
yet Han Liang remains unrepentant

73
00:06:11,784 --> 00:06:13,180
and instead criticizes Your Majesty

74
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:14,552
for placing your trust
in eunuchs like us,

75
00:06:14,584 --> 00:06:16,120
who are utterly loyal to Your Majesty

76
00:06:16,136 --> 00:06:17,592
and would follow you even unto death.

77
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,040
Your Majesty is far too merciful.

78
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,390
You should make an example of him

79
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,830
as a warning to others.

80
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,720
Get some rest.

81
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:05,170
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

82
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:13,340
♪The encounters of half a lifetime
are kept within this little world♪

83
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:20,400
♪Bit by bit,
the passing years become the preface♪

84
00:07:20,950 --> 00:07:23,380
♪The joys and sorrows of the past♪

85
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:28,930
♪Quietly dwell here♪

86
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:33,480
♪With my own hands and heart♪

87
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:36,980
♪I write my name♪

88
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:40,730
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

89
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:44,230
♪Step by step toward the light♪

90
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:48,540
♪With what I know and what I do♪

91
00:07:48,540 --> 00:07:51,740
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

92
00:07:51,740 --> 00:07:54,220
♪The long night is almost over♪

93
00:07:54,220 --> 00:08:02,380
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

94
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:25,120
Who would dare

95
00:08:25,144 --> 00:08:26,856
build a snowman outside
the Imperial Study?

96
00:08:26,904 --> 00:08:28,000
Do they have a death wish?

97
00:08:30,390 --> 00:08:31,720
That's not a snowman.

98
00:08:57,150 --> 00:08:57,750
He's dead.

99
00:09:42,500 --> 00:09:54,540
♪Let's begin with the Zuo Commentary
on the Spring and Autumn Annals♪

100
00:09:54,840 --> 00:10:01,500
♪The late Emperor's successors rose
and shaped the realm♪

101
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:13,080
♪How many emperors were wise,
and how many were foolish?♪

102
00:10:41,300 --> 00:10:44,460
(Six Months Later)

103
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:52,940
(True Joy)

104
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:53,840
I heard

105
00:10:54,030 --> 00:10:55,600
it wasn't just Minister Han who died.

106
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:58,440
Several officials
who followed Minister Han

107
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,136
in supporting the new emperor back then

108
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:02,630
were also framed
by Eunuch Cao on various charges.

109
00:11:04,270 --> 00:11:05,550
Some were dismissed,

110
00:11:06,150 --> 00:11:07,600
while others were imprisoned.

111
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,960
The emperor keeps changing.

112
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,000
The capital

113
00:11:16,630 --> 00:11:17,670
is truly in chaos.

114
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,790
Back then, I was so enthusiastic

115
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:21,600
about urging Lanxiang and Suhua

116
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:23,720
to buy land and houses in the capital.

117
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:26,270
Thankfully, Lanxiang
had better judgment.

118
00:11:26,312 --> 00:11:28,230
Not only did she refrain
from buying any herself,

119
00:11:28,248 --> 00:11:30,140
but she also persuaded us
to abandon the idea.

120
00:11:30,150 --> 00:11:31,750
We just happened to avoid it.

121
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,550
It's already June.

122
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,120
As long as Jinqi isn't back,

123
00:11:42,630 --> 00:11:43,480
I can't

124
00:11:43,790 --> 00:11:44,910
rest easy.

125
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:49,630
Aunt Lanxiang!

126
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:51,510
Aunt Lanxiang!

127
00:11:56,500 --> 00:12:00,020
(Lin Zhangjun, 24 years old)
Uncle Jinqi is back.

128
00:12:03,688 --> 00:12:05,390
His Lordship has reached the wharf?

129
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:07,870
Uncle Jinqi

130
00:12:08,008 --> 00:12:09,440
has already reached the side gate.

131
00:12:17,260 --> 00:12:19,840
♪The golden sunset♪

132
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:22,940
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

133
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,360
Look. Does this have three heads
and six arms?

134
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:29,910
One, two, three?

135
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,550
Father, this sword is so heavy,

136
00:12:32,910 --> 00:12:34,000
but I like it.

137
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,080
Slow down, Zhangcheng.

138
00:12:37,544 --> 00:12:38,910
Didn't you miss your father?

139
00:12:39,220 --> 00:12:44,660
♪I wonder if
the past has ever been heard♪

140
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:50,800
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

141
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:53,150
Look.

142
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,390
Mother is back.

143
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,360
Mother, hurry!

144
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:05,020
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

145
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:08,790
♪If the reflection isn't real,
what does it matter?♪

146
00:13:09,490 --> 00:13:14,580
♪I still remember your name♪

147
00:13:16,770 --> 00:13:19,360
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

148
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:23,880
♪For withholding its light♪

149
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:28,120
Mother, Father gave me this sword.

150
00:13:28,264 --> 00:13:30,072
He's going
to teach me swordsmanship, too.

151
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:31,750
Be careful.

152
00:13:31,750 --> 00:13:32,790
Don't hurt anyone.

153
00:13:32,910 --> 00:13:33,320
All right.

154
00:13:33,384 --> 00:13:34,850
The blade hasn't been sharpened yet.

155
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:36,720
Once Zhangcheng
has mastered swordsmanship,

156
00:13:37,030 --> 00:13:38,200
we'll have it sharpened.

157
00:13:40,104 --> 00:13:41,960
You've had a long journey,
Your Lordship.

158
00:13:45,390 --> 00:13:46,720
Go play with your sister.

159
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:49,200
I want to play with Father.

160
00:13:53,816 --> 00:13:56,360
Father and Mother haven't seen
each other for over half a year.

161
00:13:56,390 --> 00:13:58,320
Why are you getting in the way?
Come with me.

162
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,030
Father, Mother.

163
00:14:00,030 --> 00:14:00,440
Come on.

164
00:14:01,144 --> 00:14:02,728
I'll take you to play by the pond.

165
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:12,310
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

166
00:14:12,310 --> 00:14:15,600
♪Lightly trace the cause and effect♪

167
00:14:16,740 --> 00:14:19,350
♪Half a lifetime of longing♪

168
00:14:19,350 --> 00:14:22,560
♪Returns to this moment♪

169
00:14:23,100 --> 00:14:26,240
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

170
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,630
I'm home.

171
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:32,870
I've waited so long for you.

172
00:14:38,220 --> 00:14:40,760
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

173
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:45,220
♪For withholding its light♪

174
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:49,330
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

175
00:14:49,330 --> 00:14:53,130
♪Still live and thrive♪

176
00:14:53,380 --> 00:14:56,720
♪I no longer search through old dreams♪

177
00:14:56,880 --> 00:15:00,090
♪Leaving them buried
deep within the years♪

178
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,240
Originally,

179
00:15:09,272 --> 00:15:11,288
I could've made it home
for the Chinese New Year.

180
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:14,270
But at the time, we had to welcome

181
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,200
His Majesty back,

182
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:21,240
so I couldn't just leave.

183
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:23,030
It would've seemed disrespectful.

184
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:26,150
Later, I thought

185
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,390
I could make it back

186
00:15:28,870 --> 00:15:30,550
for Zhangcheng's birthday.

187
00:15:31,630 --> 00:15:34,360
But then His Majesty reclaimed
the throne.

188
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:39,200
I decided I had to leave no matter what.

189
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:41,670
But then

190
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,910
something happened to Minister Han.

191
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:50,240
The Han family has few relatives.

192
00:15:51,030 --> 00:15:52,960
Madam Han was left alone
with her children.

193
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,360
Minister Han and I

194
00:15:56,870 --> 00:15:59,030
were both disciples of Scholar Shouyi.

195
00:16:00,150 --> 00:16:01,790
I couldn't simply look the other way.

196
00:16:03,030 --> 00:16:04,480
So I made up my mind

197
00:16:05,270 --> 00:16:06,670
to escort Madam Han

198
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:10,030
and Minister Han's coffin
back to Suzhou.

199
00:16:10,790 --> 00:16:12,910
We laid Minister Han
to rest in his ancestral grave.

200
00:16:14,344 --> 00:16:16,390
By the time
the funeral arrangements were complete,

201
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,870
it was already this late.

202
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:26,910
Will Madam Han and the children

203
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:28,240
return to the capital?

204
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:31,150
Madam Han is strong-willed.

205
00:16:32,030 --> 00:16:33,510
If she stays in the capital,

206
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:35,030
I'm afraid

207
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:37,870
she'll clash
with those eunuchs sooner or later.

208
00:16:39,910 --> 00:16:42,670
At the urging
of her sister and brother-in-law,

209
00:16:43,910 --> 00:16:46,000
Madam Han settled in Jinling.

210
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,630
She now lives in

211
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:51,670
Minister Han's former residence
on Wenchang Street.

212
00:16:53,630 --> 00:16:55,000
Back when Madam Han

213
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,550
was still Young Lady Dong,

214
00:16:56,790 --> 00:16:58,270
she killed Dai Rui with her own hands

215
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,630
and avenged her father.

216
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,510
If she didn't have children now,

217
00:17:03,720 --> 00:17:05,590
I'm afraid she'd risk her own life

218
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,680
to kill Eunuch Cao.

219
00:17:10,790 --> 00:17:12,000
Scholar Shouyi

220
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:14,550
had already retired to his home,

221
00:17:15,830 --> 00:17:18,510
but when he heard that
his prized disciple had died unjustly,

222
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:20,720
he was so shaken

223
00:17:21,510 --> 00:17:24,270
that he had his grandson carry him
from place to place,

224
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:28,640
rallying renowned scholars
throughout Jiangnan

225
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:31,350
to submit a memorial to His Majesty.

226
00:17:34,070 --> 00:17:35,870
It said that the founding Emperor

227
00:17:36,270 --> 00:17:38,550
had wrongfully condemned
Grand Secretary Shen and his sons

228
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:41,400
and petitioned His Majesty

229
00:17:42,328 --> 00:17:45,208
to clear Grand Secretary Shen
and his family of all charges.

230
00:17:52,590 --> 00:17:53,750
The sages taught

231
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:56,376
that a son should not speak
of his father's faults.

232
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:59,680
Besides, during his reign,

233
00:17:59,704 --> 00:18:02,088
the founding Emperor was diligent
and incorruptible

234
00:18:02,568 --> 00:18:04,376
and was considered a wise ruler.

235
00:18:06,790 --> 00:18:08,920
That memorial won't be approved.

236
00:18:10,830 --> 00:18:12,110
His Majesty didn't approve it.

237
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:14,310
However,

238
00:18:15,070 --> 00:18:16,720
after receiving the memorial,

239
00:18:17,590 --> 00:18:20,160
he released all the other officials

240
00:18:20,264 --> 00:18:22,056
who were being held
in the imperial prison.

241
00:18:28,030 --> 00:18:29,480
Scholar Shouyi

242
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:31,656
saved them
by drawing attention elsewhere.

243
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:34,110
He made those eunuchs

244
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:35,680
wary of going too far.

245
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,240
It's good to remind them

246
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:39,160
that integrity still lives on

247
00:18:39,790 --> 00:18:40,960
in the written word.

248
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:51,510
Petty disputes
can spiral out of control,

249
00:18:52,472 --> 00:18:54,310
just as
an anthill can bring down a dike.

250
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:02,680
From now on,

251
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:07,510
I'll stay by your side with the children

252
00:19:08,400 --> 00:19:09,790
and live a peaceful life.

253
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,310
All right.

254
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:56,550
Stop.

255
00:19:58,400 --> 00:19:59,270
Straighten your back.

256
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:03,920
Look straight ahead.

257
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:06,400
Raise your hand higher.

258
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:09,240
Do you remember this move?

259
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:10,510
I do.

260
00:20:20,030 --> 00:20:20,680
I'm not tired.

261
00:20:21,310 --> 00:20:22,440
Father, I'm not hot.

262
00:20:24,510 --> 00:20:25,160
Downward strike.

263
00:20:25,928 --> 00:20:26,790
Horizontal sweep.

264
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,030
Turn and thrust.

265
00:20:28,344 --> 00:20:30,030
Do you remember what I just taught you?

266
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:31,110
I do.

267
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:31,720
Come on.

268
00:20:46,460 --> 00:20:49,060
(Lin Zhangcheng, 16 years old)

269
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:07,510
Good.

270
00:21:07,928 --> 00:21:10,030
You're every bit
as good as I was at your age.

271
00:21:12,488 --> 00:21:14,000
Father, you're flattering me again.

272
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,270
In this world,

273
00:21:18,776 --> 00:21:20,110
apart from a very small number

274
00:21:20,110 --> 00:21:21,720
of exceptionally gifted women,

275
00:21:22,270 --> 00:21:24,070
most women are naturally

276
00:21:24,310 --> 00:21:25,880
not as strong as men.

277
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:27,440
If you can avoid a fight,

278
00:21:28,110 --> 00:21:29,110
then don't fight.

279
00:21:31,048 --> 00:21:32,904
The best strategy is to outthink
your enemy.

280
00:21:32,936 --> 00:21:34,808
The next best is
to win through diplomacy.

281
00:21:34,820 --> 00:21:36,552
Only after that
should you resort to force.

282
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:38,720
Winning without bloodshed

283
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:40,590
is the best course.

284
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:44,270
So,

285
00:21:44,590 --> 00:21:45,750
Father, you mean

286
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:47,200
I should learn more from Mother?

287
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,720
I may be clever,

288
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:55,350
but your mother

289
00:21:56,070 --> 00:21:57,240
is truly wise.

290
00:21:58,720 --> 00:22:00,440
Of course you should
learn more from her.

291
00:22:02,110 --> 00:22:03,070
I'll remember that.

292
00:22:09,350 --> 00:22:10,680
But once you do have to fight

293
00:22:12,310 --> 00:22:13,270
and draw your sword,

294
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:15,880
you must show no mercy.

295
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:18,000
Either you die

296
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:20,000
or I live.

297
00:22:31,790 --> 00:22:32,590
Remember,

298
00:22:34,830 --> 00:22:35,830
your parents

299
00:22:38,070 --> 00:22:39,160
want you to live.

300
00:22:44,720 --> 00:22:45,680
I'll remember that.

301
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:47,240
I would never dare make you grieve.

302
00:23:17,160 --> 00:23:18,510
It's getting late.

303
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:21,000
I still have to hurry
to the Matchmaker Temple

304
00:23:21,110 --> 00:23:22,270
to offer incense.

305
00:23:28,216 --> 00:23:29,240
The Matchmaker Temple?

306
00:23:54,040 --> 00:23:55,030
Why are you still awake?

307
00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:01,270
Come.

308
00:24:02,520 --> 00:24:04,310
Sit with me for a while before we sleep.

309
00:24:30,400 --> 00:24:31,550
Zhangcheng said

310
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:34,350
you went to the Matchmaker Temple today.

311
00:24:35,576 --> 00:24:37,528
Were you praying
for our son to find a match?

312
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:41,720
Zhangrun is only thirteen.

313
00:24:42,830 --> 00:24:44,920
Isn't it a little early
to worry about that?

314
00:24:49,550 --> 00:24:50,550
I

315
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:56,680
was praying for a match for myself.

316
00:24:58,920 --> 00:25:00,240
In our next life,

317
00:25:02,310 --> 00:25:04,790
I want us to be husband and wife again.

318
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:14,640
The Matchmaker God
has already granted my wish.

319
00:25:58,510 --> 00:26:02,200
If I'd known I would marry you,

320
00:26:04,220 --> 00:26:05,960
I would've taken better care of myself

321
00:26:09,310 --> 00:26:11,640
back in Jinzhou.

322
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:25,400
They say

323
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:29,830
when no debts remain in this life,

324
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:32,400
there will be no meeting in the next.

325
00:26:37,550 --> 00:26:39,920
I've thought
about it carefully for a long time.

326
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:47,110
I owe you so much in this life.

327
00:26:57,680 --> 00:26:58,960
So in our next life,

328
00:27:01,750 --> 00:27:04,480
you must come find me
and make me repay you.

329
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:14,510
If you don't come find me,

330
00:27:18,920 --> 00:27:21,350
I'll follow this red thread

331
00:27:22,270 --> 00:27:23,790
until I find you.

332
00:27:24,770 --> 00:27:27,110
No matter how fate entangles us,

333
00:27:28,350 --> 00:27:29,920
in the end,

334
00:27:34,310 --> 00:27:36,270
we're meant to be husband and wife.

335
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:50,000
One lifetime

336
00:27:51,070 --> 00:27:52,030
is enough.

337
00:28:01,200 --> 00:28:03,640
We were brought together by fate.

338
00:28:16,030 --> 00:28:17,270
How could you

339
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:20,310
not give yourself to save me?

340
00:28:27,160 --> 00:28:29,030
You're such a fool.

341
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:42,980
♪Look at us♪

342
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:46,340
♪We've shared
countless beautiful moments♪

343
00:28:46,350 --> 00:28:48,750
I've already made a deal
with the Matchmaker God.

344
00:28:50,830 --> 00:28:53,400
When I became engaged to my wife,

345
00:28:55,720 --> 00:28:57,590
her name was Shen Jialan.

346
00:29:01,030 --> 00:29:03,030
When I married her,

347
00:29:06,270 --> 00:29:08,080
her name was Xu Lanxiang.

348
00:29:08,080 --> 00:29:10,800
♪There will always be someone
to share it with♪

349
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:14,110
The red thread

350
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:19,400
has always bound me to the same person.

351
00:29:21,500 --> 00:29:25,260
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

352
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:28,400
Please...

353
00:29:29,750 --> 00:29:30,920
Please...

354
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:34,730
Please...

355
00:29:34,730 --> 00:29:37,630
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

356
00:29:38,110 --> 00:29:41,110
don't get it wrong...

357
00:29:41,590 --> 00:29:44,440
♪Our bond runs deep♪

358
00:29:45,270 --> 00:29:48,360
♪Binding us closely together♪

359
00:29:48,900 --> 00:29:51,550
♪After all
the questions life has brought♪

360
00:29:51,840 --> 00:29:56,000
♪This love has never faded
in the slightest♪

361
00:29:56,860 --> 00:30:00,310
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

362
00:30:01,220 --> 00:30:04,300
♪How fortunate
to find one person in a lifetime♪

363
00:30:04,940 --> 00:30:06,500
♪Through the warm passing years♪

364
00:30:07,120 --> 00:30:12,960
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

365
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:42,980
♪Look at us♪

366
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:48,030
♪We've shared
countless beautiful moments♪

367
00:30:49,710 --> 00:30:54,720
♪Through life's winding road,
we've weathered countless trials♪

368
00:30:56,710 --> 00:31:03,440
♪I'm blessed to spend
each peaceful day and night with you♪

369
00:31:04,880 --> 00:31:07,520
♪However deep the joy or sorrow♪

370
00:31:08,130 --> 00:31:10,870
♪There will always be someone
to share it with♪

371
00:31:11,080 --> 00:31:14,200
♪Our bond runs deep♪

372
00:31:14,680 --> 00:31:17,980
♪Binding us closely together♪

373
00:31:18,460 --> 00:31:21,180
♪After all
the questions life has brought♪

374
00:31:21,350 --> 00:31:25,630
♪This love has never faded
in the slightest♪

375
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:29,830
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

376
00:31:30,660 --> 00:31:33,990
♪How fortunate
to find one person in a lifetime♪

377
00:31:34,420 --> 00:31:36,330
♪Through the warm passing years♪

378
00:31:36,580 --> 00:31:42,400
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

379
00:32:18,550 --> 00:32:24,160
♪Time unfurls a long scroll♪

380
00:32:24,700 --> 00:32:29,640
♪Flowers bloom
in turn as twilight falls♪

381
00:32:30,830 --> 00:32:36,230
♪Through rise and fall,
people meet and part as they always do♪

382
00:32:36,850 --> 00:32:42,510
♪Each plant endures its own trials
before reaching shore♪

383
00:32:42,920 --> 00:32:45,780
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

384
00:32:46,040 --> 00:32:49,100
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

385
00:32:49,470 --> 00:32:54,860
♪Yet their proud spirit fades
with wind and snow♪

386
00:32:55,070 --> 00:32:58,070
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

387
00:32:58,230 --> 00:33:01,170
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

388
00:33:01,580 --> 00:33:07,110
♪Watching the old and new
take turns in this world♪

389
00:33:07,110 --> 00:33:12,680
♪Spring comes,
and I smile upon a garden in full bloom♪

390
00:33:15,400 --> 00:33:16,310
Life is short.

391
00:33:16,590 --> 00:33:18,270
We should do what we love most

392
00:33:18,590 --> 00:33:20,000
to make this life worth living.

393
00:33:20,590 --> 00:33:23,440
I can write,
keep accounts, and run a business.

394
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:25,680
Someday, I can be a shopkeeper myself.

395
00:33:26,350 --> 00:33:27,310
I'm the eldest sister.

396
00:33:27,320 --> 00:33:29,160
If anyone is to lead the way,
it should be me.

397
00:33:29,960 --> 00:33:31,440
I want to start over

398
00:33:31,550 --> 00:33:33,096
and live a better life than before.

399
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,440
I hope

400
00:33:34,790 --> 00:33:36,440
you can all live better lives too.

401
00:33:37,510 --> 00:33:38,200
We

402
00:33:38,200 --> 00:33:39,920
should always hope

403
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:41,736
that each year will be better
than the last.

404
00:33:41,790 --> 00:33:44,030
I learned to read and began studying.

405
00:33:44,120 --> 00:33:45,750
The road ahead grew wider and brighter.

406
00:33:46,110 --> 00:33:47,510
I will learn to ride a horse,

407
00:33:47,510 --> 00:33:48,590
travel far and wide,

408
00:33:49,030 --> 00:33:50,550
and see all the wonders of the land.

409
00:33:51,790 --> 00:33:53,720
I don't want to live in fear anymore.

410
00:33:54,350 --> 00:33:56,270
I want to live a life
of wealth and privilege.

411
00:33:56,510 --> 00:33:58,640
As long as my brother is safe

412
00:33:58,720 --> 00:34:00,070
and Mother is happy,

413
00:34:00,270 --> 00:34:01,750
I'll have everything I need.

414
00:34:01,860 --> 00:34:07,780
♪Each plant endures its own trials
before reaching shore♪

415
00:34:08,050 --> 00:34:10,790
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

416
00:34:11,080 --> 00:34:14,080
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

417
00:34:14,360 --> 00:34:19,900
♪Yet their proud spirit fades
with wind and snow♪

418
00:34:21,800 --> 00:34:22,760
Great-Grandmother.

419
00:34:23,250 --> 00:34:26,290
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

420
00:34:26,610 --> 00:34:30,580
♪Watching the old and new
take turns in this world♪

421
00:34:30,580 --> 00:34:34,660
(Many Years Later)

422
00:34:37,464 --> 00:34:39,128
(Lin Zhihuan, 20 years old)
Great-Grandmother, why are you

423
00:34:39,160 --> 00:34:41,608
(Lanxiang's granddaughter)
here alone? Where are the maids?

424
00:34:42,030 --> 00:34:44,190
I wanted some time alone,

425
00:34:44,480 --> 00:34:46,400
so I sent them away.

426
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:49,510
Let's go back.

427
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:03,630
Take your time.

428
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:26,670
Great-Grandmother,

429
00:35:27,590 --> 00:35:29,230
I've seen all the other plays.

430
00:35:29,840 --> 00:35:30,840
Why

431
00:35:31,510 --> 00:35:33,150
is every woman in these plays

432
00:35:33,760 --> 00:35:35,110
named Tanniang?

433
00:35:39,480 --> 00:35:44,360
"Tan" comes from the udumbara flower.

434
00:35:46,360 --> 00:35:48,360
The wondrous Dharma

435
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:51,480
is like the udumbara flower,

436
00:35:52,030 --> 00:35:54,440
which appears only once
in a great while.

437
00:36:01,190 --> 00:36:02,800
There is a deeper meaning in the play.

438
00:36:02,824 --> 00:36:04,710
The listener must
discover it for themselves.

439
00:36:08,710 --> 00:36:09,960
"Tan"

440
00:36:10,760 --> 00:36:13,480
also evokes something fleeting
like the udumbara flower.

441
00:36:15,320 --> 00:36:16,190
In this world,

442
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:18,590
how many women can soar away
like an eagle

443
00:36:18,590 --> 00:36:20,070
or become a female general?

444
00:36:20,550 --> 00:36:22,480
For most women,

445
00:36:23,070 --> 00:36:25,230
such things truly are like
a beautiful dream,

446
00:36:25,670 --> 00:36:27,190
as fleeting as the udumbara flower.

447
00:36:31,070 --> 00:36:33,400
The udumbara flower is rarely seen,

448
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:34,630
but that

449
00:36:35,360 --> 00:36:37,630
doesn't mean it doesn't exist.

450
00:36:45,800 --> 00:36:47,030
Go on now.

451
00:36:56,300 --> 00:37:01,140
(Shen Lan, the youngest daughter,
brings honor to the Shen family.)

452
00:37:01,140 --> 00:37:05,752
(Cui Mei to her daughter and niece.
Daughters of the Shen family)

453
00:37:05,752 --> 00:37:09,580
(must be educated and well-mannered)

454
00:37:18,840 --> 00:37:20,030
(All these years,)

455
00:37:21,230 --> 00:37:24,150
(I've written play after play,)

456
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:29,150
(telling every joy and sorrow
in women's lives.)

457
00:37:32,070 --> 00:37:33,150
(But in truth,)

458
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:37,320
(when I first resolved to write plays,)

459
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:42,110
(I only wanted to tell
the story of the Shen family.)

460
00:37:42,110 --> 00:37:43,420
(Remember the present...)

461
00:37:44,110 --> 00:37:45,280
(I wanted to write down)

462
00:37:45,760 --> 00:37:48,280
(those warm days I remembered)

463
00:37:50,190 --> 00:37:51,800
(so I would never forget them.)

464
00:37:51,800 --> 00:37:54,660
(Never forget...)

465
00:37:54,670 --> 00:37:55,360
(Later,)

466
00:37:56,110 --> 00:37:57,960
(I became driven by a greater purpose.)

467
00:37:57,960 --> 00:38:01,260
(Never forget the past.)

468
00:38:01,280 --> 00:38:03,760
(I wanted more than
for the Shen family to be remembered.)

469
00:38:05,110 --> 00:38:06,760
(I also wanted to clear the names)

470
00:38:07,400 --> 00:38:08,440
(of my grandfather,)

471
00:38:09,670 --> 00:38:10,590
(my grandmother,)

472
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:12,360
(my father,)

473
00:38:13,510 --> 00:38:15,030
(and my mother.)

474
00:38:15,030 --> 00:38:20,420
(Walk this life once...)

475
00:38:20,760 --> 00:38:22,230
(The ruler guides his subjects.)

476
00:38:23,590 --> 00:38:24,880
(As subjects of the realm,)

477
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:27,150
(whether we live or die,)

478
00:38:27,670 --> 00:38:29,230
(we can only endure.)

479
00:38:29,230 --> 00:38:31,230
(Only fools live in ignorance...)

480
00:38:31,230 --> 00:38:33,440
(But no matter
how high an emperor sits,)

481
00:38:34,630 --> 00:38:36,190
(he still eats the grain of the land,)

482
00:38:37,048 --> 00:38:38,880
(wears clothes woven
from mulberry and hemp,)

483
00:38:41,230 --> 00:38:43,070
(and is sustained by the people.)

484
00:38:47,760 --> 00:38:49,030
(As long as my plays)

485
00:38:49,800 --> 00:38:51,480
(continue to be sung among the people,)

486
00:38:52,536 --> 00:38:54,400
(the injustice suffered
by the Shen family)

487
00:38:55,030 --> 00:38:56,630
(will be remembered.)

488
00:38:57,660 --> 00:38:59,660
(The Shen Family Chronicle)

489
00:38:59,670 --> 00:39:01,190
(The glow of fireflies and stars)

490
00:39:02,670 --> 00:39:03,550
(can also)

491
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:06,880
(reveal that justice
ultimately prevails.)

492
00:40:24,640 --> 00:40:27,540
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

493
00:40:28,790 --> 00:40:31,740
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

494
00:40:32,860 --> 00:40:36,500
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

495
00:40:37,180 --> 00:40:39,920
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

496
00:40:40,810 --> 00:40:44,050
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

497
00:40:45,200 --> 00:40:48,260
♪And the worries
etched between our brows♪

498
00:40:49,420 --> 00:40:53,410
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

499
00:40:53,700 --> 00:40:56,800
♪While two pairs of eyes
watch from below♪

500
00:40:59,050 --> 00:41:02,900
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

501
00:41:02,900 --> 00:41:06,540
(The Shen Family Chronicle)

502
00:41:06,980 --> 00:41:09,180
(One hundred and thirteen years later,)

503
00:41:09,650 --> 00:41:14,390
(after repeated petitions initiated
by the people,)

504
00:41:14,980 --> 00:41:18,020
(the Emperor cleared Shen Qihan
and his sons of all charges,)

505
00:41:18,136 --> 00:41:20,120
(granted him
the posthumous title Wenqing,)

506
00:41:20,248 --> 00:41:23,220
(honored the women of the Shen family
for their virtue and fortitude,)

507
00:41:23,448 --> 00:41:25,830
(returned their remains
to their ancestral home for burial,)

508
00:41:26,190 --> 00:41:28,220
(and had a tomb
and memorial shrine built.)

509
00:41:28,900 --> 00:41:33,170
♪People gather, then part♪

510
00:41:34,580 --> 00:41:37,830
♪Regret is a letter wishing you well♪

511
00:41:39,030 --> 00:41:42,040
♪Yet a figure hobbles away♪

512
00:41:43,350 --> 00:41:47,450
♪Back home,
leaves fall upon the blue-tiled roofs♪

513
00:41:47,450 --> 00:41:51,260
♪Leaving only a little house behind♪

514
00:41:51,740 --> 00:41:55,820
(Upholding the Virtue
of Generations Past)

515
00:42:01,460 --> 00:42:03,140
(Bringing honor to the family name)

516
00:42:05,490 --> 00:42:09,280
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

517
00:42:09,780 --> 00:42:13,410
♪Snow hangs thick upon the eaves♪

518
00:42:13,950 --> 00:42:18,420
♪Four seasons
wax and wane, year after year♪

519
00:42:18,420 --> 00:42:21,440
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

520
00:42:22,340 --> 00:42:25,930
♪This side of the river is also a shore♪

521
00:42:26,340 --> 00:42:30,090
♪From this side of the mountain,
I miss you deeply♪

522
00:42:30,460 --> 00:42:34,980
♪Sweeping away the grass
before the door in April♪

523
00:42:35,380 --> 00:42:41,820
(Peace)

524
00:42:42,750 --> 00:42:46,380
♪The evening breeze
blows past distant hills♪

525
00:42:47,330 --> 00:42:50,480
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

526
00:42:50,940 --> 00:42:55,288
(Love given returns as love, and
blessings bestowed return as blessings.)

527
00:42:55,290 --> 00:43:00,340
(Jia Yi, New Writings:
Spring and Autumn, Han Dynasty)

528
00:43:00,820 --> 00:43:04,900
(The End)

529
00:43:20,140 --> 00:43:24,260
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

530
00:43:27,100 --> 00:43:31,620
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

531
00:43:32,900 --> 00:43:36,820
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

532
00:43:37,500 --> 00:43:40,260
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

533
00:43:40,980 --> 00:43:43,300
♪Though all the world may fade♪

534
00:43:43,300 --> 00:43:46,380
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

535
00:43:47,900 --> 00:43:52,140
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

